abstract: >-
  Hardware Splicer is an evidence-gated workbench for agent-assisted hardware
  engineering. The 2026.09.1 artifact freezes a reproducible SPI flash adapter
  design, deterministic verification receipts, manufacturing and functional-test
  handoff, and explicit evidence/authority boundaries at PACKAGED_NOT_PHYSICAL.
